# Jarian Module Boundaries

Read: `Docs/architecture/ENTITY_OWNERSHIP.md`, `Docs/architecture/PERSISTENCE_BOUNDARY.md`

## Rule

Cross-module communication must use **Port / Facade / Public contract / Repository** — never another module's internal store.

```text
Forbidden: modules/ofogh/* → stores/useContactsStore
Allowed:    modules/ofogh/* → modules/kanoon/public/*
Allowed:    modules/pooyesh/* → subjectEntity.port → kanoon/ofogh public
```

## Owner stores (cache only inside owner module)

| Entity | Owner module | Public surface |
|--------|--------------|----------------|
| Company | Kanoon | `modules/kanoon/public` |
| Raw Lead | Ofogh | `modules/ofogh/public` |
| Order | Nabz | `modules/nabz/public` |
| Activity | Pooyesh | `interactionFacade` / `pooyesh/public` |
| Task | Pooyesh | `taskFacade` |

## Enforcement

Run `npm run check:module-boundaries` before merge.

Do not add cross-module `use*Store` imports. Extend the owner public facade instead.
